            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The combination of two concrete buildings, one built in 1927 and the other in 1972, makes this module a sort of average of existing multi-storey buildings. The life of the building is assumed to be 80 years. This module should not be used if its relative importance would be high in a certain environmental inventory.;
Synonyms: multi-story, house, Haus; 
UUID: 552ee3f6-4f6a-3b85-a72c-5707a3b0f9c7</common:generalComment>
